---
globs:
  - "src/review/prompts/**"
  - "src/agent/prompts/**"
  - "src/agent/ask/**"
  - "src/agent/description/**"
  - "src/agent/triage/**"
  - "src/agent/verification/**"
  - "src/settings/**"
---

Long investigator prompt blocks stay in prompt modules under `src/review/prompts/` and `src/agent/`. Only numeric limits and shared user-visible strings belong in `src/settings/*Constants.ts`. Do not relocate large prompt prose into settings, and do not hardcode new shared user-facing strings in feature modules when a settings constant should own them.
